{"asset_key":"ep4/gameplay_story_14604620","episode":"ep4","category":"gameplay_story","story_id":"14604620","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:1:1460462001:1":{"text":"や、やっと目が覚めたよ……","source_cn":"我……我总算清醒过来了……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5D15CF69EE41EACE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1460462002:1":{"text":"お兄ちゃん、大丈夫？さっき、なんて言ったの？","source_cn":"哥哥，你好点了吗？你刚刚说什么来着……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC33A00F39FE9246D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1460462003:1":{"text":"さっき……はっ、そうだ、弟が！ヤーゼルがいなくなったんだよ！","source_cn":"我刚刚……对，我弟弟！我弟弟雅尔泽不见了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4FF8B1DE74EB152D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:4:1460462003":{"text":"さっき……はっ、そうだ、弟が！ヤーゼルがいなくなったんだよ！","source_cn":"我刚刚……对，我弟弟！我弟弟雅尔泽不见了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4FF8B1DE74EB152D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1460462004:2":{"text":"ふぅ……ごめん、興奮して……俺っていつもこうなんだ。何かあると、すぐ焦って……","source_cn":"呼……抱歉，我又激动了，我老是这样，一遇到事就容易着急上火。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3A8B219ACC5ACA37","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_t